<title>USA: Malcomson Road UD, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik. [CORRECTED 19:17 GMT]</title>
<headline>Malcomson Road UD, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik. [CORRECTED 19:17 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company name in headline and text from William R. Hough)</p>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $2.580 million of Malcomson Road Utility District, Texas, general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.261 (corrects from 5.320) percent.</p>
</text>
